# The React Native app ships through EAS/stores, never through Vercel.
# mobile/android and mobile/ios hold multi-GB local build artifacts (Gradle
# caches, .cxx, Pods, DerivedData) that made `vercel deploy` try to upload 4.2GB
# and fail. Git builds were never affected — only 101 mobile files are tracked —
# but CLI deploys upload the working tree, so they need this.
mobile/

# Local scratch: audit screenshots and search-spike output.
.audit/
analysis/

# Android build outputs kept at the repo root.
*.aab
*.apk
